OpenRAIL++ Licence — Abliteration Studies (code, run records and labels)
Version 1.0, 2026-11-07

This licence applies to the author's own contributions in this repository:
the evaluation harness, analysis and figure scripts, run configurations,
optimisation journals and logs, per-response judge and keyword labels, the
paper sources, and this licence file. It is adapted from the OpenRAIL++
Licence v1.0 of the Code-as-Weapon Bank (2026-05-20).

It does not cover third-party material. Held-out prompt text is not
included (only identifiers and SHA-256 hashes). The Heretic fork used to run
the experiments is a separate repository under AGPL-3.0, the licence of
upstream Heretic. Released model weights keep the licence and use policy of
their base model; where this licence is also attached to a model, it applies
in addition to the base licence, and the base licence prevails where the two
conflict.

